//! (`SetVersion`/`SetSystemIdentifier`/`SetSoftwareInfo`/`SetCreationDate`/`SetScaleAndOffset`/
//! `SetBounds`/`SetPointsByReturn`), `InsertVlr`/`RemoveVlr`/`SetVlrData` and
